    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For regional first appearances within formations, compare local first-occurrence dates with older occurrences elsewhere and use phylogeographic or occupancy models to classify immigration versus local origination. A majority with prior external records supports the claim.";
